{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1060915/block/singleImage/3251987/wm/01KZQ0DMHCX2DWWYPEG4X901YY.jpg?updatedAt=1793246545\"/><figcaption>香港仔漁業及海事分署外牆維修疑吊臂平台不穩，兩男女6米墮地頭傷送院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (29 日 ) 上午 10 時 16 分，石排灣道 100A 號漁業及海事分署發生工業意外，一吊臂正進行外牆維修工作期間懷疑不檼，工作平台上的兩名男女工人從離地 6 米高的高處墮下受傷。 救援人員趕到，發現該名 62 歲姓歐男工暈倒陷入半昏迷，而 57 歲姓盧女工則清醒及後腦受傷，兩人被送往瑪麗醫院救治，警方正調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:30.344921+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:10.769072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:21.205043+00:00","content_hash":"8f3286bb7e807fece0fe28d84b94ed465bfdfcc06d092e3abcea0974f3617c54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:30.344921+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}